1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,155
You pay for cold air

2
00:00:01,155 --> 00:00:02,708
but your AC never makes any!

3
00:00:02,708 --> 00:00:03,150
How?

4
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:04,943
Inside it flows a special fluid

5
00:00:04,943 --> 00:00:06,104
through pipes inside your room

6
00:00:06,104 --> 00:00:07,818
It evaporates and soaks up heat

7
00:00:08,018 --> 00:00:09,439
then carries that heat outside

8
00:00:09,439 --> 00:00:11,117
where the compressor squeezes it hard

9
00:00:11,117 --> 00:00:12,505
until it's hotter than the street

10
00:00:12,505 --> 00:00:14,001
so it dumps the heat outdoors

11
00:00:14,201 --> 00:00:15,962
Then it squeezes through a tiny valve

12
00:00:15,962 --> 00:00:18,035
its pressure drops, and it turns icy

13
00:00:18,035 --> 00:00:19,320
and heads back in to repeat

14
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,141
That's why the outdoor unit blows

15
00:00:21,141 --> 00:00:22,766
hot air: it's your home's heat!

16
00:00:22,966 --> 00:00:24,345
Your AC doesn't make cold

17
00:00:24,345 --> 00:00:25,642
it moves your heat outside!
